   "answer": "Based on the ablation study in Table 4 of the Task-CoEvolve paper at ρ=20% evaluation budget, the mean test accuracies with standard deviations for the four configurations are: naive fixed subset: 47.2±0.6, plus Random-Resample: 48.2±0.5, plus full estimation with S-hat-max selection: 48.8±1.4, and plus variance-weighted selection (Task-CoEvolve): 49.3±0.8. [3:26]"
