   "answer": "WikiSkill's knowledge and tracking layers consist of the Wiki Layer (wiki/) and the Skill Layer (skills/). The Wiki Maintainer updates the Wiki Layer by consolidating traces into structured knowledge, while the Skill Proposer updates the Skill Layer by proposing skill updates based on the wiki and traces. [5:11][5:12]"
